 1537.0], [809.0, 1567.0], [382.0, 1567.0]]}]}}, "markdown": {"text": "<div style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"imgs/img_in_image_box_288_278_690_525.jpg\" alt=\"Image\" width=\"33%\" /></div>\n\n\n<div style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"imgs/img_in_image_box_72_602_227_728.jpg\" alt=\"Image\" width=\"13%\" /></div>\n\n\n一方水土，养一方人。胖东来肥沃而独特的文化土壤培养了我们每一位胖东来人，从高层到员工，我们都会以良好的心态，以坦荡的胸怀迎接每天的挑战，经受各种的考验。虽然我们不敢讲已经读懂了人生，读懂了社会，读懂了市场，但可以自信地说，我们正在成熟，不在幼稚，不在迷茫，因为我们心中有爱。虽然我们同过去一样，很忙，很累，但忙得有序，累的快乐，眼前有了开阔的道路，有了更明确的目标。今天，在这里，让我们每一位优秀的团队舵手激情开航。\n\n## 绽放美丽笑容\n\n<div style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"imgs/img_in_image_box_77_994_1134_1374.jpg\" alt=\"Image\" width=\"88%\" /></div>\n", "images": {"imgs/img_in_image_box_288_278_690_525.jpg": "https://pplines-online.bj.bcebos.com/deploy/official/paddleocr/pp-ocr-vl-16-online//5585af3b-37ae-47b7-998e-a2093a8f2619/markdown_0/imgs/img_in_image_box_288_278_690_525.jpg?authorization=bce-auth-v1%2FALTAKDN8mY5KlNI7zaRpLmOqrw%2F2026-08-09T11%3A09%3A24Z%2F-1%2F%2F8ef822c4a6085d1870c80630c3ee80f45c5eb7f94af81fb4fa5cb3f47283d51a", "imgs/img_in_image_box_72_602_227_728.jpg": "https://pplines-online.bj.bcebos.com/deploy/official/paddleocr/pp-ocr-vl-16-online//5585af3b-37ae-47b7-998e-a2093a8f2619/markdown_0/imgs/img_in_image_box_72_602_227_728.jpg?authorization=bce-auth-v1%2FALTAKDN8mY5KlNI7zaRpLmOqrw%2F2026-08-09T11%3A09%3A24Z%2F-1%2F%2F0fa26e391040f88c7af004687a4873e664b791d9b4be6cdfaa98b9711c173f3b", "imgs/img_in_image_box_77_994_1134_1374.jpg": "https://pplines-online.bj.bcebos.com/deploy/official/paddleocr/pp-ocr-vl-16-online//5585af3b-37ae-47b7-998e-a2093a8f2619/markdown_0/imgs/img_in_image_box_77_994_1134_1374.jpg?authorization=bce-auth-v1%2FALTAKDN8mY5KlNI7zaRpLmOqrw%2F2026-08-09T11%3A09%3A24Z%2F-1%2F%2F4871e0ce83ce120e4d0807371a9129611fbce35b8440bffe480199a863ea87aa", "imgs/img_in_image_box_84_997_1129_1124.jpg": "https://pplines-online.bj.bcebos.com/deploy/official/paddleocr/pp-ocr-vl-16-online//5585af3b-37ae-47b7-998e-a2093a